# Best-props list (active sports)

When ranking or locking **Standard Over / Standard Under / Goblin** plays for a slate, always output **four sections**: WNBA, MLB, Soccer, Tennis.

- Do not skip a sport because the pool is thin. If nothing clears L5, say so in that section.
- Soccer/tennis often store hits in `last5_over` / `last5_under` (not `l5_over`). Use those when `l5_over` is empty.
- **Hard list gate:** directional L5 >= 4; Goblins Over-only; no Demons. **WNBA / WNBA1H / WNBA1Q** list + Flex require directional **L5 = 5** for Standard OVER, Standard UNDER, and Goblin OVER (L5>=4 is not listed). **MLB** uses keep props 1–10 (same gates as Goblin-70); MLB Standard stays off. **Tennis** Goblin OVER uses keep gates in `utils/tennis_keep_gates.py`: Games Won Standard−Goblin >=4 (83% n=331) **or** L10>=8+(vs lefty | L5 2nd-won%>=45.7) (union 82.6% n=501), then **fade** when player is ranked 50+ spots better than opponent (opp−player gap ≥50; keep∩50+ 52% n=25 → keep without 83.2% n=500); Total Games L5>=4+L10>=8 (78.7% n=61) **or** L10>=8+vs lefty (union 79.3% n=135); no D. Tennis Standard UNDER Aces / Double Faults is **off** after serve-actual backfill (pre-~90% was missing→0 inflation; post-backfill ~57% / ~29%). Tennis Standard OVER Games Won: L10>=8+(L5gap>=5 | L5 2nd-won%>=45.7). Other tennis Standard / Goblin Aces/DF stay off. **Soccer** uses keep props in `utils/soccer_keep_gates.py`: Shots L5=5+L10>=8 (76% n=21); SOT L5>=4+Off (68% n=68; Off = STARTER or HIGH_VOL or top-3); Saves L5>=4+own D (Weak|Below OVER; no opp-D fallback; optional OPP_OFF Elite|Above). Fade Goals / G+A / assists / fouls / volume props. Soccer Standard O/U uses the same per-prop **list** gates. **Ticket** SOT/Saves still need directional L5=5 on top of that pool entry (L5>=4 is list-only). Thin-history competitions (`utils/competition_history.py` on `league`): block tags like WORLDCUP* with too little prior depth — not a hardcoded tournament list. **CFB** uses keep props in `utils/cfb_keep_gates.py`: Goblin OVER Rush Attempts / Kicking Points off the list (33%/20% ungated). Player TDs stay on the L5>=4 list but are faded from the L5=5 ticket stack. Standard Rec Yards UNDER stays on the list but is blocked from the cover-stack ticket path. Pass Yards Goblin OVER list stays L5>=4; badge and tickets both skip D via `cfb_pass_yards_goblin_skip_d` (D is N/A, not a Silver miss).
- **NFLP (preseason) exception:** 2025 L5 / snap% is starter volume, not tonight. Week-3 starters sit or play 1 series — do not list Sit/cameo skill **overs** even with L5 4+ (tiny cameo lines like pass 25.5 still drop). Backup QBs play the bulk (Q2–Q4); 2025 snap 40–70% is a spot start, not tonight’s cameo. Backup skill overs need D (Weak|Below Avg); L5 is not required. Kickers still use L5 >= 4. **Regular-season NFL (League=NFL)** list gate stays directional L5≥4. Sep-1 current-season filtering is for **honest sample flags** (`THIN_*` / `games_used`) — not a ban on using last-season or preseason boxes when judging face consistency. D stays a veto on NFLP skill overs into Elite | Above Avg | Avg.
- **Goblin / Standard face preference (manual + list builds):** Prefer faces with directional **L5=5**, accept **L5≥4** except **WNBA / WNBA1H / WNBA1Q** (L5=5 only). **Do not play 3/2 (or worse) faces**. That L5 window **may include last season and NFL preseason** — it does not have to be current-season-only. Prefer the **deepest Goblin** that still clears L5≥4 over a near-Standard Goblin that only clears 3/5 (WNBA still needs L5=5). **Standards use the same L5 consistency preference**, but they **must still clear our gates and filters** (sport keep gates, ticket L5=5+L10≥8+D where required, D alignment, cover floors, MLB/tennis/soccer/CFB exceptions above) — consistency alone does not put a Standard on the card.
- **D is badge-only (not a hard filter)** except NFLP skill overs (see above). Failing D on other sports should still appear, usually as **Silver** when D is the only miss (Gold = L5 + Cover + Delta + Dir + D + Rank all pass). **Exception:** CFB/CFB1H Pass Yards Goblin OVER — D is N/A in badge logic (same `cfb_pass_yards_goblin_skip_d` as tickets); it does not cost Silver.
- **D alignment for badges (all pipeline sports — WNBA, MLB, Soccer, Tennis, NBA, CFB, CBB, NHL, NFL, etc.):**
  - Overs vs Weak | Below Avg; Unders vs Elite | Above Avg. Avg never passes D.
  - **MLB pitcher Hits Allowed / ERA / pitcher Ks:** Opp Def is opponent **offense** (hits, scoring, K-rate), mapped into the same Weak→Elite buckets. Do not use opponent team pitching for those.
  - **MLB hitter TB / H+R+RBI / hits:** opponent **pitching** (run prevention) plus player **BA**. Gate is BA>=.275 (min 80 AB). Display: **BA .312** then **Opp pitch Weak|Below** (leaky staff). Team Bat Strong|Above is labels-only.
  - **MLB hitter_strikeouts exception:** Overs vs Opp pitch Elite|Above; Unders vs Weak|Below (stingy staff → more batter Ks). Rank also inverts. Do not invert pitcher strikeouts (those stay on lineup K-rate).
  - **Tennis:** individual opponent (ATP/WTA). Same Weak|Below / Elite|Above bands. Unknown opponent does not pass D.
  - **NFL tackles / tackles_ast / solo:** Def Tier is opponent **rush offense** (`opp_rush_off_rank`), not opp pass D. Same Weak|Below OVER / Elite|Above UNDER bands (chunk rush OFF → UNDER; weak rush OFF → OVER). Soft own-D is context only. See `Sports/NFL/data/nfl_keep_fade.md`.
- **MLB Goblin OVER keep vs fade (numbered props 1–21):** Keep 1–10 on the per-prop gate below. Fade 11–21 (Runs, Singles, batter Walks, PA, RBIs, 1st-inning walks/runs, HR, 2B, 3B, SB) and all Demons / Standard (no Standard cell ≥70% at n≥40).
  - **1 Walks Allowed:** L10≥8 + Own pitch Weak|Below (leaky staff).
  - **2 Pitches Thrown:** L10≥8 + Own pitch Weak|Below.
  - **3 ERA:** Goblin 0.5 + L5=5 + L10≥8. Ban 1.5+. No rank gate.
  - **4 Pitcher Ks:** L10≥8 + Own pitch Elite|Above (stingy staff).
  - **5 Hits Allowed:** L10≥8 + Opp bats Strong|Above. Do not require own leaky pitching.
  - **6 Pitching Outs:** L10≥8 + Own pitch Elite|Above.
  - **7 H+R+RBI:** BA>=.275 + L5=5 + Opp pitch Weak|Below (80.8% n=104).
  - **8 Hitter Ks:** K%>=28 + L10≥8 + Opp pitch Elite|Above (76.6% n=325). On the Goblin list and Goblin-70 tickets.
  - **9 Hits / 10 Total Bases:** BA>=.275 + L5=5 + Opp pitch Weak|Below (71% n~170). No L10, no cover, no team Bat.
  - **Live check-in bar (not ~90% L5-gated backtest cells):** Pitcher Ks ~80%, HA ~83%, ERA ~88%, Walks ~81%, Hitter Ks ~77%, H+R+RBI/Hits/TB ~65–70%. ERA and hitter L5-gated props should hold closer to backtest; pitcher volume at ~80% is expected L10-primary cost. Grade `wind_out_hot` + L10≥8 boosts against `data/reports/mlb_pitcher_l10_primary_gates.md`.
- **Diamond / Platinum (on top of Gold):** Diamond = Gold + directional L10 >= 8 AND season HR > 70% (min 10 games vs today's line). Platinum = Gold + exactly one of those two extra gates. Remaining Gold has neither. **CFB PRIOR_SEASON_FILL / PRIOR_SEASON_L5** (weeks 0–5 last-year pad on this player's own boxes) stays Gold at most — never Diamond/Platinum. `l5_sample_n` / `games_used` stay current-season counts so a filled face L5=5 is not a clean 2026 sample.
- **Prop tier (S–D) is the market; badge is the play.** They stack. Sort S → A → B → C → D then Diamond → Platinum → Gold → Silver → Bronze. S = MLB pitcher Goblin Ks/walks/pitches/**hits allowed** (L10-primary band) and NBA1Q Goblin counting (~80%+ L5=5). A = WNBA Goblin scoring/reb+ast/FGA, NBA Goblin scoring, tennis games, soccer saves, pitching outs. WNBA Goblin PRA is B. Promotions into A/S: MLB Goblin H+R+RBI with D pass; MLB Goblin total bases with cover + D; hitter Ks with cover ≥1. Shadow cells tag as **W** and stay on the list. `scripts/rank_best_props_today.py` prints `S/Diamond`, `A/Gold*`, `W/Silver`. NBA/NHL/CBB/NFL/CFB/Golf now get letters (unlisted Goblin OVER = C, Standard = D) instead of a blank tier.
- Prefer `scripts/rank_best_props_today.py` so all four sports are generated the same way. CFB prints as an extra section when `outputs/<date>/cfb/step8_cfb_direction_clean.xlsx` exists. Golf prints as an extra section when `outputs/<date>/golf/step8_golf_direction_clean.xlsx` exists.
- **Tennis list window:** keep ET today + 2 days (slam first rounds post Saturday–Monday). Do not ranker-filter tennis down to the slate date only.
- **Tennis format:** BO5 Total Games (line > 31.5) must not list from BO3 last-5 (all games / avg < 32). Inverse of the BO3-line slam strip. If tennis step1 exists and step8 is missing, warn — do not print `(no step8 file)` as an empty slate.
- That script **must not** use a day-prior board just because it lives in the open Cursor checkout. It picks the worktree whose step1 `fetched_at` is the **slate date** (usually `PropORACLE_main_cp` after 1AM/8AM). If you rank by hand, pass `--step8-root` to that tree when this checkout's `fetched_at` is yesterday.

# Pipeline tickets (all sports)

**Live `/tickets` is always both:** Goblin-70 groups first, graded-main mixer under. Builder `scripts/build_goblin70_tickets.py --write-web` merges from the grade pool so a refresh cannot wipe STRONG / MLB Goblin OVER / tennis mixer groups. 9AM / 10:30 / 1PM / 4:30 refetches rebuild Goblin-70 and patch mixer **lines**; they do not drop mixer slips that left the live board.

**70% ticket engine (top of the card):** Goblin OVER and Standard Over/Under that clear the same gate (except MLB and most tennis Standard). Hard gates: directional **L5 = 5**, directional **L10 >= 8**, **and directional D** (OVER Weak|Below Avg; UNDER Elite|Above Avg; Avg/unknown fail; MLB hitter Ks invert). **WNBA Goblin PRA** also needs Off (usage HIGH/STAR or minutes HIGH) on top of that (80.6% n=36). **WNBA Goblin Rebounds 3.5+** skips D (keep L5=5+L10>=8+cover; <=2.5 still needs D). **WNBA Goblin Assists 2.5** is off tickets (1.5 stays). **WNBA Goblin Assists** with entering-game poss/g>=18 (FGA+0.44×FTA+TO) is off tickets (L5=5 64.2% n=53). **Fantasy** is off tickets for every sport (printed list already skipped it; ticket fade was WNBA-only so WNBA1Q/1H/NBA still cleared the generic stack — closed). **WNBA Goblin Points / Rebounds / Pts+Reb / Pts+Ast** also need season avg >= line+cover_unit (A-only 56–66% vs A∩B; Assists/3PM/Reb+Ast stay on plain G70 — Assists A-only 82.4% beats A∩B 76.6%). **Tennis Goblin OVER** uses keep props in `utils/tennis_keep_gates.py`: Games Won Standard−Goblin >=4 (83.1% n=331) **or** L10>=8+(vs lefty | L5 2nd-won%>=45.7) (82.6% n=501), then **fade** player-better-50+ (opp−player gap ≥50; keep∩50+ 52% n=25 → without 83.2% n=500); Total Games L5>=4+L10>=8 (78.7% n=61) **or** L10>=8+vs lefty (79.3% n=135). No D. **Tennis Standard UNDER Aces / Double Faults** is off after serve-actual backfill (pre-~90% was missing→0 inflation). **Tennis Standard OVER Games Won** is L10>=8+(L5gap>=5 | L5 2nd-won%>=45.7). Other tennis Standard stays off. **Soccer** uses keep props in `utils/soccer_keep_gates.py`: Shots L5=5+L10>=8; SOT L5>=4+Off **list** then L5=5 **ticket**; Saves L5>=4+own D **list** then L5=5 **ticket** (Weak|Below OVER; no opp-D fallback; optional OPP_OFF). Other soccer props stay off. **CFB** uses keep props in `utils/cfb_keep_gates.py`: Pass Yards Goblin OVER is L5=5+L10>=8+cover, no D (74% ungated; D-fail 90%). Player TDs fade from the L5=5 stack (0.5-line). Standard Rec Yards UNDER fades from the cover-stack (L5=5 is 0/5 vs 41% base). Standard Rush Yards UNDER keeps the full stack. Rush Attempts / Kicking Points Goblin OVER stay off. **Golf** has no opponent D — L5=5 + L10>=8 without D. **MLB Goblin OVER** uses keep props 1–10 in `utils/mlb_keep_gates.py` (pitcher Walks/Pitches/Ks/Hits Allowed/Outs = L10≥8 + D/own-pitch/opp-bats as listed; ERA 0.5 + L5=5 + L10≥8; H+R+RBI BA≥.275+L5=5+D; Hitter Ks K%≥28+L10≥8+D; Hits/TB BA≥.275+L5=5+D). MLB Standard stays off. Cover floor still applies on other sports (per-prop typical |last5−line| when mapped — PRA ~+3.7, FGA ~+1.1, 3s ~+0.7, NFL/CFB pass yards ~+15, rec/rush yards ~+8 — else WNBA/Tennis/NBA >= 2, Soccer/NFL unmapped >= 1). No Demons. No shadow cells. Goblin Power slips stay all-Goblin. Standard O/U that clear their keep gate ticket as their own Power 3s, not mixed onto Goblin slips. Sports: WNBA, WNBA1Q, WNBA1H, MLB, Soccer, Tennis, NBA, NBA1Q, NBA1H, NFL (regular season), CFB, CBB, WCBB, Golf, NHL. NFLP stays on its own playing-time track (sit/cameo skill overs dropped; backup skill needs D; kickers L5>=4). A sport or prop with no keep-file rule is off. NBA, CBB, and WCBB are out of season, not missing a gate. NHL is in season and has no keep gate yet (not backtested; see data/reports/nhl_goblin_gate_backtest.json), so it stays off tickets. Each keep file says whether its rule replaces the L5/L10/D stack or adds to it. Who gets in is the keep gate with the highest hit rate for that prop, and the leg must also have directional L5 = 5. Leg p is the shrunk hit rate of that gate cell, not model_prob. Build 2- and 3-leg slips from the whole high-hit-rate pool, taking the best-EV group each round. Goblin and Standard may share a slip; the all-hit payout follows the Goblin count on that slip. Pick Power unless Flex N-correct EV is higher. Stop when nothing left has positive EV or its all-hit payout is under 1.4x. One player-prop once (the same player may add a different prop). Same game is allowed. Flat $20. Goblin 3-leg Power is 2.3x ± 0.5. Mixed floors: 2-leg with 1 Goblin 2x, 3-leg with 1 Goblin 3.25x, 3-leg with 2 Goblins 2.5x.

**Standard:** same L5=5+L10≥8+D gate as Goblin, except MLB Standard is off, tennis Standard is OVER Games Won only (L10>=8 + gap/2nd-won; UNDER Aces/DF faded after backfill), soccer Standard uses the same Shots/SOT/Saves keep gates, and CFB Standard Rec Yards UNDER is off the cover-stack (Rush Yards UNDER stays). Do not mix Standard onto Goblin Power slips. Standard slips are Power 3s from the Standard pool, as many as that pool fills.

Combined / graded-main (under Goblin-70) uses directional **L5 = 5** only for mixer seed and MAIN Goblin/Standard recency floors (`PROPORACLE_MAIN_*_MIN_L5_HITS` default 5). Seed order is **L5=5+D → L5=5 no-D** — L5≤4 never enters the mixer seed pool. Tennis mixer Goblins already use the keep gates above. Soccer mixer legs are Shots / SOT / Saves only (goals/G+A/assists/volume props dropped).
